  <item>
    <title>Vol.57 《好东西》- 我拒绝绑架，所以我相对自由</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67513a6ea314b553c64dd6ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67513a6ea314b553c64dd6ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Dec 2024 05:51:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>电影《好东西》上映之后引发了社交媒体的全方位讨论，片中每个角色都鲜活明亮，独具特色。导演也延续自己一贯的风格在台词中强势输出自己的女性观点。会客厅主播们在观影后感受颇多，本期就来和大家聊聊关于女性主义的共情时刻和如何面对“结构性问题”的大山。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【省流剧透】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 看完全片之后印象最深刻的片段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 女孩子之间总是那么美好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 钟楚曦美到直击内心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 妈妈的日常 = 磅礴的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a> 看了部电影被种草了不少电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 电影中表达的女性主义观点，最共情的是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">08:44</a> 我有我的世界，谁都别来管我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 礼貌和边界感对女性来说很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a> 拒绝雌竞，世界更美好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a>关于对片名《好东西》的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="977">16:17</a> 真实的感受到性别不平等的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> 除了夸夸，对于电影的反面意见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a> 相比于《好东西》，《出走的决心》像是一言不发的重拳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> “女权表演艺术家”们，停止表面功夫，多点实际行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 真正的平等是不强迫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 小叶对于海王的爱-清醒的沉沦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 听到这些“渣男经典话术”，姐妹们警铃响起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> 新知识点：“结构性压迫”，男女都有的结构性问题？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《滥俗的歌》- 钟楚曦</span></p>]]></description>
