  <item>
    <title>Vol.54 走进珂学-一生要强的中国女人学不来撒娇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6734205343dc3a438736df5c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6734205343dc3a438736df5c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 03:55:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>入秋的互联网大戏“走进珂学”又一次把名媛这个话题带进大家的茶余饭大家在玩笑品红酒话术的同时，不知是嘲笑着的是弄巧成拙的现场还是物化女性的本身。</span></p><span></span><p><span>女明星主播们其实试图从另一个视角看待，名媛课学员们掌握好一段关系的关键似乎是更加会“非暴力沟通”解决问题。撒娇是表象，掌沟通中的心理才是关键，本期就让我们一起来继续探讨沟通的艺术。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【省流剧透】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 《再见爱人》和珂学串台的演绎现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> &nbsp;课前预习-珂学热梗回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 珂学称为网络笑料的背后原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 珂学和麦琳，哪个更令人窒息？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> 情绪价值在生活中的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">08:58</a> 情绪价值如何才能给到“心趴”上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 宇宙最强撒娇公式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> 装傻是给普信男最好的情绪价值？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> 人人需要肯定 - 升级顺毛撒娇小帖士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> 情绪价值靠天赋还是靠后天努力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 一生要强的中国女人-非暴力沟通也是一种撒娇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 如何避免“疏离性的语言”对彼此的伤害</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> Wish (feat. GREE)</span></p>]]></description>
