  <item>
    <title>Vol.51 本人毫无情绪包袱-放下个人素质，拒绝精神内耗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670e8e42db2cf8275779fa6e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670e8e42db2cf8275779fa6e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Oct 2024 15:46:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>女明星会客厅主播们近期日常内耗，不是为了工作，就是为了感情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>何为内耗，内耗的具体表现是什么？内耗因何而来？到底如何与内耗和谐共处？如何缓解内耗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>人的一生仿佛都要不断修炼自己的情绪，本期就让我们一起走进科学，走进内耗～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【省流剧透】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 内耗的定义到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">06:36</a> 内耗的具体表现/判断标准，供电子姐妹们自我诊断</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> MBTI的玄学-性格与内耗的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 什么样的行为可以提醒自己：你内耗啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 姐妹们在感情里何时会内耗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 向男性学习，直接摆烂，拒绝内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 友情中基本不会内耗？说到底还是因为边界感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">24:03</a> 工作中导致内耗的情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a> 随着年龄的增长，内耗的程度变少了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a> 降低内耗的小方法</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】every-little-part</span></p>]]></description>
